Subject: NAN：建立失败的 NDP 不扣减 NDI 活跃引用

NDI 引用只在 NDP 建立成功后增加。建立失败的通知仅上报失败，
不移除共享 NDI 的密钥或扣减其他活跃 NDP 的引用。

--- a/wpa_supplicant/nan_supplicant.c
+++ b/wpa_supplicant/nan_supplicant.c
@@ -800,7 +800,9 @@
 {
 	struct wpa_supplicant *wpa_s = ctx;
 
-	wpas_nan_remove_ndi_sta(wpa_s, local_ndi, peer_ndi, remove_sta, gtk_id);
+	if (!failure)
+		wpas_nan_remove_ndi_sta(wpa_s, local_ndi, peer_ndi,
+					remove_sta, gtk_id);
 	wpas_notify_nan_ndp_disconnected(wpa_s, ndp_id->peer_nmi,
 					 ndp_id->id, local_ndi, peer_ndi,
 					 reason, locally_generated, failure);
